{"text":"kuruntokai","n":21,"lines":["வண்டுபடத் ததைந்த கொடியிணர் இடையிடுபு","பொன்செய் புனையிழை கட்டிய மகளிர்","கதுப்பிற் றோன்றும் புதுப்பூங் கொன்றை","கானங் காரெனக் கூறினும்","யானோ தேரேன் அவர் பொய்வழங் கலரே"],"tr":["vaṇṭupaṭat tatainta koṭiyiṇar iṭaiyiṭupu","poṉcey puṉaiyiḻai kaṭṭiya makaḷir","katuppiṟ ṟōṉṟum putuppūṅ koṉṟai","kāṉaṅ kāreṉak kūṟiṉum","yāṉō tērēṉ avar poyvaḻaṅ kalarē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"mullai","tinai_ta":"முல்லை","speaker_ta":"தலைவி கூற்று","poet_ta":"ஓதலாந்தையார்","speaker_en":"the heroine (talaivi)","poet_tr":"Ōtalāntaiyār"},"scan":{"meter":"āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"5 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"1×5, 3×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 17, veṇcīr 2, other 1"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"veṇṭaḷai 9, āciriyattaḷai 8, kalittaḷai 1, ? 1"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"},{"name":"long lines","ok":true,"detail":"1 five-foot line (neṭilaṭi)"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"வண்டுபடத்","tr":"vaṇṭupaṭat","foot":"kūviḷaṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வண்","tr":"vaṇ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"டுப","tr":"ṭupa"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"டத்","tr":"ṭat"}]},{"text":"ததைந்த","tr":"tatainta","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"ததைந்","tr":"tatain"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"த","tr":"ta"}]},{"text":"கொடியிணர்","tr":"koṭiyiṇar","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கொடி","tr":"koṭi"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"யிணர்","tr":"yiṇar"}]},{"text":"இடையிடுபு","tr":"iṭaiyiṭupu","foot":"karuviḷaṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"இடை","tr":"iṭai"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"யிடு","tr":"yiṭu"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"பு","tr":"pu"}]}],[{"text":"பொன்செய்","tr":"poṉcey","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பொன்","tr":"poṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"செய்","tr":"cey"}]},{"text":"புனையிழை","tr":"puṉaiyiḻai","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"புனை","tr":"puṉai"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"யிழை","tr":"yiḻai"}]},{"text":"கட்டிய","tr":"kaṭṭiya","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கட்","tr":"kaṭ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"டிய","tr":"ṭiya"}]},{"text":"மகளிர்","tr":"makaḷir","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மக","tr":"maka"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ளிர்","tr":"ḷir"}]}],[{"text":"கதுப்பிற்","tr":"katuppiṟ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கதுப்","tr":"katup"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"பிற்","tr":"piṟ"}]},{"text":"றோன்றும்","tr":"ṟōṉṟum","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"றோன்","tr":"ṟōṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றும்","tr":"ṟum"}]},{"text":"புதுப்பூங்","tr":"putuppūṅ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"புதுப்","tr":"putup"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"பூங்","tr":"pūṅ"}]},{"text":"கொன்றை","tr":"koṉṟai","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கொன்","tr":"koṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றை","tr":"ṟai"}]}],[{"text":"கானங்","tr":"kāṉaṅ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கா","tr":"kā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னங்","tr":"ṉaṅ"}]},{"text":"காரெனக்","tr":"kāreṉak","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கா","tr":"kā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"ரெனக்","tr":"reṉak"}]},{"text":"கூறினும்","tr":"kūṟiṉum","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கூ","tr":"kū"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"றினும்","tr":"ṟiṉum"}]}],[{"text":"யானோ","tr":"yāṉō","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யா","tr":"yā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னோ","tr":"ṉō"}]},{"text":"தேரேன்","tr":"tērēṉ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தே","tr":"tē"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரேன்","tr":"rēṉ"}]},{"text":"அவர்","tr":"avar","foot":"malar","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"அவர்","tr":"avar"}]},{"text":"பொய்வழங்","tr":"poyvaḻaṅ","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பொய்","tr":"poy"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"வழங்","tr":"vaḻaṅ"}]},{"text":"கலரே","tr":"kalarē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கல","tr":"kala"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரே","tr":"rē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"வண்டு","parts":[{"text":"வண்டு","lemma":"vaṇṭu","gloss":"bee"}],"gloss":"bee"},{"surface":"பட","parts":[{"text":"படு","lemma":"paṭu","gloss":"swarm/fall"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"-a","gloss":"infinitive suffix"}],"gloss":"to swarm"},{"surface":"ததைந்த","parts":[{"text":"ததைந்த","lemma":"ததைந்த","gloss":"that is dense"}],"gloss":"that is dense","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கொடி","parts":[{"text":"கொடி","lemma":"koṭi","gloss":"vine"}],"gloss":"vine"},{"surface":"இணர்","parts":[{"text":"இணர்","lemma":"iṇar","gloss":"flower cluster"}],"gloss":"flower cluster"},{"surface":"இடையிடுபு","parts":[{"text":"இடை","lemma":"iṭai","gloss":"middle/interval"},{"text":"இடு","lemma":"iṭu","gloss":"place"},{"text":"பு","lemma":"-pu","gloss":"verbal participle suffix"}],"gloss":"interspersing"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பொன்","parts":[{"text":"பொன்","lemma":"poṉ","gloss":"gold"}],"gloss":"gold"},{"surface":"செய்","parts":[{"text":"செய்","lemma":"cey","gloss":"make"}],"gloss":"made of"},{"surface":"புனை","parts":[{"text":"புனை","lemma":"punai","gloss":"adorn"}],"gloss":"adorned"},{"surface":"இழை","parts":[{"text":"இழை","lemma":"ilai","gloss":"jewel"}],"gloss":"jewels"},{"surface":"கட்டிய","parts":[{"text":"கட்டு","lemma":"kaṭṭu","gloss":"wear/tie"},{"text":"இய","lemma":"-iya","gloss":"adjectival participle suffix"}],"gloss":"worn"},{"surface":"மகளிர்","parts":[{"text":"மகளிர்","lemma":"makaḷir","gloss":"women"}],"gloss":"women"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கதுப்பிற்","parts":[{"text":"கதுப்பிற்","lemma":"கதுப்பிற்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"றோன்றும்","parts":[{"text":"றோன்றும்","lemma":"றோன்றும்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"புதுப்பூங்","parts":[{"text":"புதுப்பூங்","lemma":"புதுப்பூங்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கொன்றை","parts":[{"text":"கொன்றை","lemma":"கொன்றை","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"கானம்","parts":[{"text":"கானம்","lemma":"kāṉam","gloss":"forest"}],"gloss":"the forest"},{"surface":"கார்","parts":[{"text":"கார்","lemma":"kār","gloss":"rainy season"}],"gloss":"the rainy season"},{"surface":"என","parts":[{"text":"என்","lemma":"eṉ","gloss":"say"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"-a","gloss":"infinitive suffix"}],"gloss":"as/saying that"},{"surface":"கூறினும்","parts":[{"text":"கூறினும்","lemma":"கூறினும்","gloss":"even if it declares"}],"gloss":"even if it declares","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"யானோ","parts":[{"text":"யான்","lemma":"yāṉ","gloss":"I"},{"text":"ஓ","lemma":"-ō","gloss":"emphasis particle"}],"gloss":"As for me"},{"surface":"தேரேன்","parts":[{"text":"தேர்","lemma":"tēr","gloss":"believe"},{"text":"ஏன்","lemma":"-ēṉ","gloss":"first person singular negative suffix"}],"gloss":"I do not believe"},{"surface":"அவர்","parts":[{"text":"அவர்","lemma":"avar","gloss":"he (honorific)"}],"gloss":"he"},{"surface":"பொய்","parts":[{"text":"பொய்","lemma":"poy","gloss":"lie"}],"gloss":"lies"},{"surface":"வழங்கலரே","parts":[{"text":"வழங்கு","lemma":"vazaṅku","gloss":"practice/utter"},{"text":"அலர்","lemma":"-alar","gloss":"third person plural negative suffix"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"-ē","gloss":"emphasis particle"}],"gloss":"is not one who utters"}]}],"literal":"Bees swarming, dense vine-clusters interspersing, / like gold-made, beautifully crafted ornaments worn by women / appearing in their tresses, the fresh flowers of the Konrai tree, / even if the forest declares, \"It is the rainy season!\", / as for me, I do not believe it; he is not one to utter lies.","translation":"Though the forest declares, 'The rainy season has come!' by showing the fresh blossoms of the konrai tree—which appear like gold ornaments beautifully crafted and worn in the dark tresses of women, interspersed among dense vine-clusters where bees swarm—as for me, I will not believe it. For he is not one to speak untruths.","modern":"வண்டுகள் மொய்க்குமாறு நெருங்கிய கொடிகளிலுள்ள பூங்கொத்துகளுக்கு இடையே, பெண்கள் அணிந்துள்ள பொன்னால் செய்யப்பட்ட அழகிய அணிகலன்களைப் போலக் கூந்தலில் தோன்றும் புதிய கொன்றை மலர்களைக் கொண்டு, 'கார்காலம் வந்துவிட்டது' என்று இந்தக் காடு கூறினாலும், நான் அதனை நம்பமாட்டேன்; ஏனெனில், அவர் பொய் சொல்பவர் அல்லர்.","explanation":"This poem is spoken by the heroine to her companion during the onset of the rainy season. The hero had promised to return from his journey before the rains, but he has not yet arrived. Looking at the forest, the heroine sees the golden konrai flowers blooming amidst the green foliage, resembling golden ornaments in a woman's dark hair. Although the forest's blossoms proclaim that the rainy season has begun, the heroine refuses to believe it. She reasons that her lover is a man of absolute truth, so if he has not returned, it cannot truly be the rainy season yet. This expression of deep trust amidst anxiety is a classic theme of patient waiting (iruttal) in the Mullai (pastoral) landscape.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}